            "reviewBody": "This was wayyyy too sweet. Only one person of the group liked it, and that was after they already had 4 other drinks (so basically they would've liked anything, haha). It tasted pretty much like sweet and sour and nothing else. I ended up reversing the orange juice and sweet and sour, and that didn't help. It's just missing something to tone it down. Maybe more tequila?",
